# JitBuiltin variants exempted from the
# `tests/enforce_closure_op_env_seeding.rs` env-seeding check.
#
# Format: `<VariantName>` per line. Anything after the variant on the
# same line is treated as a comment.
#
# A variant belongs here only if its trampoline dispatcher is NOT an
# eval-delegation site — i.e. it never evaluates a delegated expression
# against an `eval::Env` (constant values, fast paths over arguments the
# JIT already evaluated, or the generic runtime dispatch).

Rt               generic runtime dispatch over evaluated args, no Env
Unknown          error synthesis only (#1043 bug-compat), no eval delegation
Format           applies a format to one evaluated value, no Env
Loc              constant {"file","line"} literal, no eval delegation
EachError        error-message synthesis from one evaluated value
Env              cached $ENV snapshot, no eval delegation
Builtins         constant builtins list
InputLineNumber  reads CLI input-line counter
InputFilename    reads CLI input-filename state
RecurseCollect   pure DFS over an evaluated value
PathsCollectAll  pure DFS over an evaluated value
Slice            pure slice over evaluated args
